Ashleigh,

To use warpRefMesh, I have described this workflow in detail in my geomorph user guide <https://github.com/geomorphR/geomorph/raw/gh-pages/geomorph%20user%20guide/Quick_Guide_to_Geomorph-3.0.pdf> in section 14.10.4.1.

You need to import the coordinates digitised on that mesh, and have them in a p x k matrix (rows are landmarks, columns are the x, y, z). Likely keep as default centered = FALSE.

Emma

