Dear Pablo,

Yes, this is possible.

But you must use only a single specimen in define.sliders() when defining the landmarks to slide - since you only need to plot a single specimen.

So:
define.sliders(x$coords[,,1], nsliders=6, surfsliders=NULL)

Will work.

Emma

